{"id":"84e66db8dad1fed1","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees.md","title":"DNC 与两种无固定点函数的度表征","display":"thm-dnc-fpf-degrees — DNC 与两种无固定点函数的度表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees","aliases":["20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees"],"display":"thm-dnc-fpf-degrees — DNC 与两种无固定点函数的度表征","chapter":"5","section":"5.4.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 5.4.5（完整三向编译）；Definition 10.3.1","source_printed_pages":[119,185],"source_pdf_pages":[154,217],"depends_on":["[[20-df-dnc]]","[[20-df-fpf]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dnc-fpf-degrees — DNC 与两种无固定点函数的度表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 5.4.5（完整三向编译）；Definition 10.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>119</span><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span><span>217</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fecd8e75f6904d75\" href=\"?note=fecd8e75f6904d75\" title=\"20-df-fpf\">20-df-fpf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；所有下列见证都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算全函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fecd8e75f6904d75\" href=\"?note=fecd8e75f6904d75\" title=\"20-df-fpf\">20-df-fpf</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc-fpf-degrees}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists f\\le_T A\\ \\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\le_T A\\ \\forall e\\ [\\varphi_{g(e)}\\ne\\varphi_e]\\\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists h\\le_T A\\ \\operatorname{DNC}(h).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc-fpf-degrees}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists f\\le_T A\\ \\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\le_T A\\ \\forall e\\ [\\varphi_{g(e)}\\ne\\varphi_e]\\\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists h\\le_T A\\ \\operatorname{DNC}(h).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式推第二式：若两个部分函数相等，其定义域也相等，所以集合 FPF 见证本身即足够。第二式推第三式：s-m-n 给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(e)\">\\(d(e)\\)</span>，程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(e)\">\\(d(e)\\)</span> 先等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(e)=j\">\\(\\varphi_e(e)=j\\)</span>，再模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_j\">\\(\\varphi_j\\)</span>，故停机时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{d(e)}=\\varphi_j\">\\(\\varphi_{d(e)}=\\varphi_j\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e)=g(d(e))\">\\(h(e)=g(d(e))\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e)=\\varphi_e(e)=j\">\\(h(e)=\\varphi_e(e)=j\\)</span>，便得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{g(d(e))}=\\varphi_{d(e)}\">\\(\\varphi_{g(d(e))}=\\varphi_{d(e)}\\)</span>，矛盾。第三式推第一式：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(e)\">\\(\\theta(e)\\)</span> 搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 首个元素（空时发散），用 s-m-n 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(e)\">\\(q(e)\\)</span> 计算常值部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda x[\\theta(e)]\">\\(\\lambda x[\\theta(e)]\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(z)\">\\(t(z)\\)</span> 为单元素集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{z\\}\">\\(\\{z\\}\\)</span> 的统一索引，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(e)=t(h(q(e)))\">\\(f(e)=t(h(q(e)))\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\varnothing\">\\(W_e=\\varnothing\\)</span>，单元素集合不同；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=W_{f(e)}\">\\(W_e=W_{f(e)}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(e)=h(q(e))=\\varphi_{q(e)}(q(e))\">\\(\\theta(e)=h(q(e))=\\varphi_{q(e)}(q(e))\\)</span>，违背 DNC。三个转换均全且保留相对计算上界。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 5.4.5（完整三向编译）；Definition 10.3.1；印刷页 119, 185；PDF 第 154, 217 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-fpf","status":"resolved","id":"fecd8e75f6904d75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-fpf]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-fpf]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-fpf","status":"resolved","id":"fecd8e75f6904d75","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-fpf]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-fpf]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{